OL,3,GNEWSAFrom football to foxtrot for NI
OL,4,Acreator joining Strictly line-up
OL,5,
OL,6,FAway from his day job of interviewing
OL,7,Fthe likes of Erling Haaland and Kylian
OL,8,FMbappe, John Nellis has taken to a
OL,9,Fdifferent discipline to showcase his
OL,10,Ftalents.
OL,12,FThe social media star, from Newcastle,
OL,13,FCounty Down, has been paired with Katya
OL,14,FJones in this year's series of Strictly
OL,15,FCome Dancing.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
