OL,3,GNEWSAFrom football to foxtrot for NI
OL,4,Acreator joining Strictly line-up
OL,5,
OL,6,FNellis quit his job as an air traffic
OL,7,Fcontroller four years ago and is now
OL,8,Fflying high on social media as one of
OL,9,Fthe UK's biggest sports content
OL,10,Fcreators, with a combined audience of
OL,11,Fmore than 20 million followers across
OL,12,Fsocial media.
OL,14,FBBC News NI has spoken to people in his
OL,15,Fhometown about how they feel about him
OL,16,FCha Cha Cha-ing across the famous
OL,17,FStrictly dancefloor.
